    <!-- ============================ CLERK-OF-THE-WORKS ============================ -->
    <section class="section advisory-clerk" id="clerk">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
          <span class="eyebrow">Service Area Two</span>
          <h2>Clerk of the Works</h2>
          <hr class="rule">
        </div>
        <p class="advisory-lede" data-reveal data-delay="1">On-site supervision by our Clerk of the Works throughout every building activity is one of the most effective tools for cost containment, safeguarding quality control and keeping the work true to the plans and specifications. Across each stage of construction, we provide:</p>

        <article class="svc-card clerk-card" data-reveal data-delay="2">
          <ul class="adu-points cols-2">
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Project-records maintenance, including contractor certificates of insurance</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Process &amp; quality control</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Review of the general contractor's record-keeping</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Monitoring the construction schedule &amp; identifying potential delays</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Construction-cost monitoring</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Safety-program review</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Investigation of &amp; recommendations on proposed change orders</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Assistance negotiating the cost of proposed change orders</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Review of contractor progress-payment requests</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Shop-drawing &amp; submittal review (samples and other submittals)</li>
            <li><span class="ck">&#10003;</span> Monthly progress-report submission</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

